{"synopsis":"Tepat ketika Liu Jinshan mengira dia bisa mati tanpa penyesalan keluarganya dimusnahkan\nAkibatnya ia bertekad untuk hidup hanya agar ia dapat melihat satusatunya cucunya yang masih hidup Liu Seol mencapai usia dewasa\nSaat dia berjuang untuk membesarkannya dan melatihnya dengan tubuhnya yang menua Liu Seol yang terlahir dengan bakat seniman bela diri terbaik\ntumbuh jauh lebih cepat dari yang dia kira Jangan khawatir Kakek aku akan melindungimu mulai sekarang","alternative_title":"Grandfather Warrior and Supreme Granddaughter, Grandpa Samurai and Granddaughter of the Supreme, 할배무사와 지존 손녀","author":"Ilhyang & Shin Ui-Cheol","artist":"KIM Myung-Hyun","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"0ed90f70-d9af-4a22-aa2a-820d1b4756c2","number":"114","chapter":"114","title":"","date":"2026-07-16","released":"2026-07-16"},{"chapter_id":"8151f368-8916-40d4-8efa-938c84dd6201","number":"113","chapter":"113","title":"","date":"2026-07-16","released":"2026-07-16"},{"chapter_id":"7ee1067b-acf8-49d3-a3d0-27cee00fc3a6","number":"112","chapter":"112","title":"","date":"2026-07-03","released":"2026-07-03"},{"chapter_id":"d568aca6-7ced-4e02-b763-0375676ad637","number":"111","chapter":"111","title":"","date":"2026-07-03","released":"2026-07-03"},{"chapter_id":"1c1f7f0c-ebce-41f7-9dbb-753a19fe3a14","number":"110","chapter":"110","title":"","date":"2026-06-30","released":"2026-06-30"},{"chapter_id":"30636f58-a158-4511-9b72-6d372b7cc9d5","number":"109","chapter":"109","title":"","date":"2026-06-30","released":"2026-06-30"},{"chapter_id":"5515e1e2-b446-4c56-b885-5d06639675d3","number":"108","chapter":"108","title":"","date":"2026-06-26","released":"2026-06-26"},{"chapter_id":"f7dfa492-20b3-467f-a87d-ca2f34821dda","number":"107","chapter":"107","title":"","date":"2026-06-26","released":"2026-06-26"},{"chapter_id":"b7644147-ff57-4b35-9f7f-2ed62c44d1e3","number":"106","chapter":"106","title":"","date":"2026-06-26","released":"2026-06-26"},{"chapter_id":"483bf539-293c-4b6e-8f7d-e79f6c1d62f4","num